
%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': { 'fontSize': '28px' }}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 用户
    participant Frontend as 前端
    participant Controller as ProjectSeriousProblemController
    participant Service as ProjectSeriousProblemServiceImpl
    participant Mapper as ProjectSeriousProblemMapper
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant OrgService as OrgService
    participant Feishu as IFeishuService
    participant Handler as 责任人

    User->>Frontend: 填写重大问题信息
    Frontend->>Controller: POST /TbProjectSeriousProblem
    Controller->>Service: 保存重大问题记录
    Service->>Mapper: 插入重大问题数据
    Mapper->>DB: 写入重大问题表
    DB-->>Mapper: 返回保存结果
    Mapper-->>Service: 返回保存结果

    Controller->>Service: 发送重大问题通知
    Service->>OrgService: 查询根因部门负责人
    OrgService-->>Service: 返回部门负责人列表

    loop 每个通知接收人
        Service->>Feishu: 发送重大问题通知卡片
        Feishu-->>Handler: 推送问题通知
        Feishu-->>Service: 返回发送结果
    end

    Service-->>Controller: 返回处理结果
    Controller-->>Frontend: 返回新增成功
    Frontend-->>User: 显示提交成功

    Handler->>Frontend: 查看问题并维护处理进展
    Frontend->>Controller: PUT /TbProjectSeriousProblem/update
    Controller->>Service: 更新重大问题进展
    Service->>Mapper: 根据主键更新问题记录
    Mapper->>DB: 更新重大问题表
    DB-->>Mapper: 返回更新结果
    Mapper-->>Service: 返回更新结果
    Service-->>Controller: 返回处理结果
    Controller-->>Frontend: 返回更新成功
    Frontend-->>Handler: 显示更新成功